WEBVTT

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.470
Just for a minute... really...

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.450
It's all right. I won't tell anyone.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.990
You know I would never tell 
anyone else about this.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.920
Thanks for being there today.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.890
You can cry again if you need to.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:31.930
Right into my chest!

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.020
H-Hey! Don't tease me!

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.510
You were crying, too!

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:41.660
That's mean! When did you 
get so mean, Onii-chan?!

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.380
Okay, sorry.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.300
If you're going to apologize, 
do it through your actions!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.260
The best way to heal a wound...

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.740
is to give it a kiss. Everybody knows that!

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.210
So...

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.650
Kiss me right here.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.690
Why on your lips?!

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.150
Hrgh! Hrgh! Hrgh! Hrgh!

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:00.610
Hrmph!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.770
Ohragi-san?!

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:04.250
Huh?

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:08.490
You're both violating the 
love pact! No flirting!

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.900
Isn't that a bit rude?

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.950
Shall I punish her?

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.970
Can I talk to you, Momo?

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:15.910
Hmph!

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.840
No flirting!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:26.650
Hey, Sueharu-oniichan, why don't we 
look at your childhood photo album?

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.720
What brought this on?

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.110
The younger Shirokusa-san is in 
some of those photos, isn't she?

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.980
Of course! Shiro was really cute as a kid!

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:34.970
Flash!

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:36.670
I want to see!

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:40.850
But if we look at it together, we'll be 
called out for "violating the love pact."

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:43.200
There are photos in there I've 
never shown anyone before.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.170
Previously unseen?!

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.980
Don't you want to see them?

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:51.040
Oh, dear, Ms. Love Police. What happened 
to all the energy you had before?

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:56.970
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! We wanna 
see Shion-chan's best side!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.440
They're previously unseen photos.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.720
Some of them might be real treasures!

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:05.930
V-Very well...

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.180
What was that? I couldn't hear you clearly.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:13.190
I'll let it slide if you'll 
show me these photos!

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.690
You're so easy.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.240
How aggravating.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.330
Just one of you is unbearable enough, 
but when it's both of you together...

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:23.260
Too bad for you!

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.910
Sueharu-oniichan and I 
are the ultimate duo!

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:27.780
Whoa, Momo...

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:29.790
<b>Kill</b>

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:29.790
<b>Kill</b>

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.370
Flash!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:31.700
Yah!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.670
Hmph!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:43.010
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.520
<b>Haru's Documentary Production Notes</b>

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.520
<b>• Childhood friend advantage</b>

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.520
<b>• Memorable place</b>

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.520
<b>• Secret base</b>

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.520
<b>• Someone you want to keep a hold on</b>

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.490
Okay.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:55.770
<b>Class
Duty</b>

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:54.670
So our plan to calm the waters after 
those articles came out is working.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:55.780
Already?

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.850
Having Collect's help is huge.

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:02.540
But there's no telling when that damn 
president will start shit again.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:06.400
We need to upload that documentary 
ASAP and wrap all this up.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.920
Do we know for sure that 
President Shun is in on it?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.880
No, but I'm convinced he is.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.130
If you believe that, it's probably true.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:19.600
Collect wants to air the true ending at 
the same time we air the documentary.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.350
Is that cool?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.450
If we can finish it in time, sure.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:25.010
What actors will be in it 
other than me and Momo?

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:28.840
Both the child actors from that time 
have left show business already,

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.780
so Collect picked Shida-chan 
and Kachi to do it.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:32.270
Huh?

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:36.220
And they've both already agreed to it.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.180
But they're both amateurs! 
Collect is okay with that?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.750
The impression they left with the 
commercial contest is still strong.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.150
It'll generate more buzz than 
using random actresses.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:49.030
So here you go. Give one 
to Shida-chan, too.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:46.370
<b>Child King: The True Ending</b>

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:46.370
<b>The Ultramarine Alliance</b>

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:46.450
<b>Child King: The True Ending</b>

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:46.450
<b>The Ultramarine Alliance</b>

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:46.580
<b>Child King: The True Ending</b>

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:46.580
<b>The Ultramarine Alliance</b>

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:46.660
<b>Child King: The True Ending</b>

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:46.660
<b>The Ultramarine Alliance</b>

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.870
<b>Child King: The True Ending</b>

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.870
<b>The Ultramarine Alliance</b>

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.860
You're filming after school, right?

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.990
Maru-chan!

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.080
What is with you guys?

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.010
Hey.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.820
Where are we going?

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:08.650
You'll see when we get there.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:11.000
Hey, now!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:11.880
There!

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.890
<i>I love Haru.</i>

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.290
<i>I don't remember when it started,</i>

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:20.370
<i>but I'm pretty sure it was in our 
early elementary school years.</i>

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.430
<i>I could give all kinds of reasons for it,</i>

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.080
<i>but the biggest reason is 
"there is no reason."</i>

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:31.220
<i>It's what the emotions in the 
deepest part of my heart want.</i>

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.800
<i>I believe that's what love is.</i>

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.880
<i>When did I start to want Haru so badly,</i>

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.950
<i>and when did Haru start to want me?</i>

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:45.700
<i>Until second grade, Haru was a 
totally normal kid like any other.</i>

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.960
<i>He caused trouble at times, 
but he was sort of a mood maker,</i>

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.150
<i>and I think everyone generally liked him.</i>

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.740
<i>When he debuted as an actor in third grade,</i>

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.520
<i>he didn't get any major roles.</i>

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:02.910
<i>But after he was chosen for the lead 
role in </i>Child Star<i> in fourth grade,</i>

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.470
<i>the environment around him changed.</i>

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:10.880
<i>It seemed like a wall was forming 
between him and everyone else.</i>

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.190
<i>He was always very down-to-earth,</i>

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:17.640
<i>so being the center of people's attention 
and envy must have felt gross to him.</i>

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.710
<i>He became more and more isolated.</i>

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.330
<i>Then in fifth grade, 
that accident happened.</i>

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:29.610
<i>Haru was in a state where nobody's 
voice could reach him.</i>

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:34.110
<i>When he disappeared from TV and people 
started saying irresponsible things,</i>

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:38.370
<i>Haru was so hurt that he wasted 
away and isolated himself.</i>

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.790
<i>The reason he still came to my 
house to eat meals so often</i>

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:46.830
<i>was because his father started 
taking on a lot more stunt work.</i>

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:51.530
<i>No matter how deep he sank, he was 
still the same Haru to my sisters.</i>

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:55.030
<i>That's just the sort of kind person he was.</i>

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.770
<i>The Haru who was hailed as a star,</i>

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.900
<i>the Haru who retired and 
fell into depression,</i>

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.150
<i>the Haru who keeps to himself at school,</i>

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.370
<i>the Haru who does fun things 
with my sisters...</i>

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.840
<i>I'm the only one who's seen all of them.</i>

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.980
<i>His good sides, his bad sides, 
his hopes, his disappointments...</i>

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.420
<i>I know them all.</i>

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.150
<i>Because I'm his childhood friend.</i>

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:21.090
<i>But over time, Haru stopped 
coming to my house as often.</i>

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:24.960
<i>It was during the spring break 
before we started middle school</i>

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:28.200
<i>that things changed drastically 
between Haru and me.</i>

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:32.650
<i>It started when my mom went back to work.</i>

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:38.680
<i>She started asking me to take care of my 
sisters and the house while she was at work.</i>

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:41.930
<i>Why was I the one she 
always asked to do that?</i>

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.420
<i>I wish I'd been born a younger sister!</i>

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:48.720
<i>The first time I ran away from 
home, I was angry and scared.</i>

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.780
<i>And that's when...</i>

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.560
<i>I saw Haru heading off somewhere.</i>

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.750
This is...

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.760
Do you remember that day?

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.230
Yeah, how could I forget?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.470
You followed me all the way up here

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.640
and said you wouldn't leave until 
I told you what I was doing.

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.830
Talk about nostalgic.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.530
Pretty cool secret base, right?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:24.500
Yeah.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.200
Why did you come all the way out here?

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:30.660
I'm embarrassed to say it, 
but I'm afraid to be at home.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:31.670
Huh?

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:34.530
When no one else is there... you know...

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.130
Then why don't you come to my house?

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:40.440
Yours is... a little too lively.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.770
The contrast when I get back 
to my house is too much.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:48.430
I thought I understood you, but I had no idea.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:49.020
I'm sorry.

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:51.530
Y-You don't have to worry about me.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.740
But why are you here?

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:54.760
I ran away.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:55.940
Huh? Why?

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.640
I bet you made your sisters 
eat your cooking, right?

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:02.410
Then they had to go to the hospital 
and things got awkward.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.730
I'm gonna pound you!

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:05.370
I'm just kidding.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.080
I see...

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:11.690
You did kinda get the short end of 
the stick as the oldest sister.

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.290
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:16.080
I can't change the fact 
that I was born first,

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.090
and I don't hate being the oldest sister.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.050
I do love my little sisters.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:23.120
It's nothing compared to 
what you've been through.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.960
What's the point in comparing it?

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:29.200
Still, it's okay. Thanks, Haru.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.070
I'm the one who should thank you.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.530
I'm glad you're here.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.990
You always worry about me and talk to me.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.780
I was in such a bad mood,

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:43.280
but when I saw how upset 
you looked, I couldn't do anything.

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:47.640
I'm only getting by now because I had you.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:50.450
So my feelings did get through to you.

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:53.920
Thanks so much, Kuro. Really.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:56.550
You dummy. Why are you crying?

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.900
You're crying, too!

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:02.850
<i>I realized that we had a bond,</i>

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>that there was a special 
connection between us.</i>

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.720
<i>And that was the greatest 
memory ever for me.</i>

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:15.030
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:15.030
<b>\hEpisode 12
Childhood Girlfriend</b>

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.770
Hey, Haru... There's something 
important I want to talk about.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.550
I-Important?

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:28.700
Yeah, very important.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.700
Listen, Haru.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:32.580
I love you.

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.630
I mean that in the romantic sense.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.850
I love you, Haru.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.770
I'm glad to hear that, but...

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:42.050
Why did you shoot me down at the 
confession festival, then?

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:45.520
Because... you shot me down first.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.790
Revenge, then?

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.740
Yeah.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.930
I mean, I love you so much, 
but you just said "sorry."

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:00.320
I was so sad and frustrated. 
I just wanted to do <i>something</i>.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.010
So you hate me?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.360
Yes, I hate you.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.320
But I love you even more.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.460
I rejected you in the heat of the moment,

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.510
but there's no way you're 
satisfied with that, right?

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.950
So I won't make any excuses.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:16.920
I figured if you knew that was 
my reason, you'd hate me.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.410
Kuro...

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:20.350
You know...

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:24.800
When you wouldn't tell me how you really felt,
I didn't understand anything anymore.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.820
It hurt so much, and made me so sad.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.240
I just wanted you to be honest with me.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:32.520
But now...

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:37.310
More than anything, I'm just 
glad you finally told me.

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:37.980
Haru...

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:42.450
I was just so weak and cowardly. I'm so sorry.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:46.410
I caused you a lot of 
trouble, too. We're even.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.470
Thanks.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:54.070
Haru, can you give me an answer now?

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:54.790
Huh?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:56.260
Answer?

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.090
I'm so glad you're in this world.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.920
Onii-chan and I are the ultimate duo!

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:03.920
<i>H-Hang on...</i>

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.930
<i>Let me get all this straight.</i>

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.290
<i>Do I love Kuro? That's a definite yes.</i>

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:09.840
Yay!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.220
<i>Do I accept her feelings, then?</i>

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.560
<i>I want to, but...</i>

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:18.020
<i>I can't say that Kuro is the only 
one I love 100% right now.</i>

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.620
<i>Should I really accept her feelings 
when my own aren't all there?</i>

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.460
<i>I'm really grateful to Kuro,</i>

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:28.350
<i>so I need to go about this the right way.</i>

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.370
<i>What would be best for her?</i>

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.390
<i>Keeping in mind the future 
and everything else,</i>

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:37.790
<i>what answer would make her the happiest?</i>

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.390
<i>K-Kuro, I...</i>

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.450
And time's up.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.040
Huh?

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:49.460
Sorry, but I set a secret rule that 
if you took longer than ten seconds,

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:51.550
I wouldn't accept your response.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.080
So I won't wait for your answer any longer.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.950
What the hell? Is that 
a rule of confessing?

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:03.530
I think you hesitated because there's 
a certain girl you can't forget.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:04.440
Right?

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:09.270
If that's how you feel, I don't want 
you to come to a conclusion right now.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:12.680
It's not good to date someone 
if you're only half-committed.

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:16.040
But not everything in this 
world is black or white.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.870
It's all shades of gray.

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:22.510
So I'm proposing the concept 
of a "childhood girlfriend."

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:27.770
Childhood girlfriend? So a girlfriend 
who's like a childhood friend?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:30.630
That, plus "a girlfriend you 
want to keep a hold on."

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:30.970
Huh?

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:35.220
I know you think favorably of me.

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:39.200
I think getting awkward because you won't 
date me despite that would be too extreme.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:43.370
Well, yeah... Friends of the 
opposite sex are precious,

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.810
so I'd be sad to lose one 
over a love confession.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.040
Besides, we're childhood friends, right?

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:55.490
But that's not a relationship that ends when 
one of us confesses or gets rejected.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:01.050
So if we talk it out, we should be able 
to find even better common ground.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.960
And that's a "childhood girlfriend"?

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:03.940
Yeah.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:07.270
It's a promise that even though 
we're not going to date now,

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:11.190
we will later if the 
circumstances are right.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:13.220
That's not just saving someone for later?

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:15.830
No, that has ulterior motives,

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.140
and it gives the advantage to the 
one who's been confessed to.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.750
A childhood girlfriend is just a promise,

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.290
so it keeps us equal.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:26.170
If I decide that I don't like 
this relationship, it's over.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:31.230
It can be ended at any time, but there's
 no time limit on a response,

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.900
so no one has to stress out or kill all 
other thoughts to settle on an answer.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:39.160
If one of us takes an interest in someone else,
 the other can't fault them.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.120
But there's still a risk of being rejected.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:45.520
It's a relationship based on a 
promise that includes all that.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:47.970
I think I get it, but maybe not...

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.090
What is it like, specifically?

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:53.060
Well, let me see. For example...

00:13:56.990 --> 00:13:59.650
Holding hands is no problem, right?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.930
We both know we like each other,

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:04.680
so it's actually recommended.

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:05.660
What?!

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:07.580
And what about dating?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.780
I think it's fine.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:10.440
Touching shoulders or hips?

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.970
Depends on the time and place.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.500
What about foreheads and cheeks?

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.670
Depends on the time, place, 
and type of touch.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.480
And kissing?

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.000
I think that's the sign that 
you're ready to be a couple.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.240
And touching your chest?

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.370
Scummy.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.330
Honestly, Haru...

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.800
Damn it!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:30.440
My patience! That's a high 
school boy's instinct!

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:34.260
You really are a dummy, you know that?

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.420
That's something to look forward to 
after you start going out, isn't it?

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.890
Crap! My IQ is melting away...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.770
You'd better be ready, Haru.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:51.940
If you kiss me or do anything pervy, 
we're officially a couple.

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:55.680
I'm fine with this childhood 
girlfriend thing, but are you?

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.150
Of course I am.

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:01.870
It puts me in a position close to being 
your girlfriend without getting rejected.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:05.660
And if I have a chance at being your 
girlfriend with enough effort...

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:08.340
It'll motivate me to try harder 
at all kinds of things!

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:11.560
But you have to put effort in, too.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:14.470
If you don't give me enough attention,

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.760
I might just go away.

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.760
O-Okay... I'll try.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.400
With studying, especially.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.490
That's right.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:24.890
Your big sister will help you again.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:31.040
Also, this relationship is a secret. Okay?

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:33.900
Y-Yeah... I got it.

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:38.350
<i>Logic is melting...</i>

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:42.640
Come on, we're going home, Haru. Walk!

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:44.270
R-Right...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.680
\h\hP.S. Also, about the true ending of <i>Child King</i>...
I'm looking forward to it just a tiny bit.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.680
Shion

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.730
