00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.690
<b>The Ultramarine Alliance</b>

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:18.400
<i>It'll be fine. I can switch 
into gear without a problem.</i>

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.000
<b>Entertainment Club</b>

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.000
Ah, I thought you'd be here.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:26.700
Ugh.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.920
I saw the documentary and the true ending.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:33.500
It made me remember how it felt when 
I decided I wanted to be an actor.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.220
Feel free to tell Sueharu that personally.

