00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.220
\hLegendary child actor Maru-chan,
 now in high school, has a new...

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.220
\hWhat happened to Maru-chan that day:
 a documentary of the true...

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:39.430
No, we never cleared up that 
initial misunderstanding.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.850
I don't know how I'd even approach him.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:44.070
Oh, God, you sound like an actual fan.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:46.370
I don't feel ashamed or anything.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:49.530
I got to tell you instead. 
Did it bother you?

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:54.190
So, my thoughts on all this.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.110
I think the top winner was you.

00:16:57.110 --> 00:17:00.660
You knew what President Shun 
was doing from the start.

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:05.150
President Shun's goal was to use 
Maru-kun's past to damage him.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:09.070
So you decided to produce a documentary,

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:11.400
so that Maru-kun could 
overcome his past himself.

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:14.170
The idea of having all three 
girls who love Maru-kun

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.880
take him to places where they have 
memories with him was fantastic.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:20.910
That was Maria-chan's idea, actually.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:21.850
Oh?

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.980
I thought if it wasn't your idea, 
it must've been Shida-san's.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.700
Shida-chan doesn't contribute 
much on the creative end.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:32.470
She was a beast again as far as the romantic 
aspect and Sueharu went, though.

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:34.300
Did she do something?

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:37.270
She was in the tightest pinch she's 
been in since he rejected her.

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:42.040
Kachi stayed at Sueharu's house 
and used her best charms on him,

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.930
but Sueharu got tired of the 
whole battle of appeal.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:48.460
Not to mention, his heart was leaning 
toward Kachi on the Okinawa trip.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:53.460
Then the three of them had a meeting and 
made it a "Sanbou Ichiryouzon" deal.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:57.080
Did you notice that Kachi had the 
biggest disadvantage there?

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:57.720
Huh?

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:02.210
The only disadvantage Shida-chan and 
Maria-chan had was cutting back on the charms.

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:05.670
Kachi had to live with him. 
That's obviously overkill.

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:06.740
Good point.

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:10.810
And Kachi, the one with the biggest disadvantage, 
was the one Shida-chan got this agreement out of.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:11.930
Scary.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.420
But the real game is just getting started.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.460
Meaning?

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:20.050
After filming her part of the documentary, 
Shida-chan confessed to Sueharu again.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:24.000
And the moment she could tell he was 
going to reject her, she canceled it,

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.120
and then she proposed a "childhood 
girlfriend" relationship.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.370
Childhood girlfriend?

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.010
Not "more than friends, 
but less than lovers,"

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:34.840
but "a girlfriend who's like a childhood 
friend that you want to keep a hold on."

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:39.010
She came up with that? No wonder 
Shirokusa-chan's struggling.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:43.040
Personally, I thought she hit 
him in just the right spot.

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.190
I think feelings for another person

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:51.480
often start with thinking that they 
have some kind of interest in you.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:55.070
If just one side has those feelings, 
it'll never go anywhere,

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:58.940
so the art of telling them you like them 
without openly confessing it becomes crucial.

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:02.170
People who are skilled in relationships 
have that going for them.

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.490
Shida-chan threw the ultimate
punch of a confession

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.360
in the way that would hit him the hardest,

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.950
then saved their relationship with the 
"childhood girlfriend" label as insurance,

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:10.890
creating a way to move forward.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.240
Gotta respect her ability to come 
up with ideas and act on them.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:16.800
I'd never have the guts to suggest 
being a childhood boyfriend,

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.970
or the strength to actually make it happen.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:22.980
Agreed. If I ever suggested that,
 I'd be killed.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:26.580
Anyway, I had nothing but praise 
for Shida-chan all along,

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.810
but at the same time, I kinda thought she 
was just a desperate high school girl.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.990
What do you mean?

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:35.010
Well, she confessed to him, 
but didn't become his girlfriend.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.420
But Sueharu is still beside her.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:40.810
That basically means they're back where 
they were before the confession festival.

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:43.650
If she'd ditched her pride 
and kept apologizing,

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:45.480
they'd probably be dating right now.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.950
<b>The same goes for 
Shirokusa-chan...</b>

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.950
Pride isn't that easy to just throw away.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.050
Of course.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:53.500
Which is why I think she's just a 
desperate high school girl deep down.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.680
By the way, how do you know 
Shida-san confessed to him?

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:59.600
She told me herself.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:04.080
She said I'd either figure it out or drag 
it out of Sueharu eventually anyway,

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.550
so she gave me an explanation 
and a warning in advance.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.440
A warning?

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.160
"If you tell anyone, 
be ready to pay for it."

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.710
Wait, but you just—

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.640
If it gets out, you're just as guilty as me.

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:19.890
You mean in the sense that if you tell 
someone else, you can blame me?

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:23.600
You think I would've told you if I didn't 
stand to gain at least that much?

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:24.900
Oh, man...

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.990
<b>Hozumino High School</b>

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:32.100
By the way, did you know 
you have a fan club now?

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:33.200
What? For real?

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.830
It sounds like a lie, but it's true.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:39.520
Oh, man, what am I gonna do?
 I'm that popular now?

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:41.790
I didn't even really do anything.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:44.410
Isn't Maru-senpai hot?

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:46.250
I watched his dance video a hundred times!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:49.460
Huh... Haru has a fan club, eh?

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.190
So there are some scumbags hoping 
to make a pass at Su-chan.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:56.650
It looks like they need 
to learn their place.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:57.610
I'll crush them.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.310
I'll destroy them.

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.040
Let's make them regret it!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:01.920
Huh?

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:49.990
<i>Ren-kun?</i>

00:22:49.990 --> 00:22:50.750
<i>Nina...</i>

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:51.480
<i>Ren-kun!</i>

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.270
<i>Heya, Nina-chan!</i>

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:55.350
<i>Wait... Ren?!</i>

00:22:56.610 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>Ren! You're awake!</i>

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.690
<i>Thank goodness!</i>

00:23:01.010 --> 00:23:02.240
<i>Hina?</i>

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:04.550
<i>And Mirei...</i>

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.240
<i>You were asleep for six years, Ren-kun.</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>I was?</i>

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:14.480
<i>We all waited for you.</i>

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:19.450
<i>So many times, we thought 
you'd never wake up again.</i>

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>Welcome back, Ren-kun.</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:22.350
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:24.540
<i>It's because of you three that I could...</i>

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:28.430
<i>no, that I made it back.</i>

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:30.720
<i>As long as I have you three...</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:33.110
<i>I don't need anything else.</i>

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:37.840
<i>Thank you.</i>
